<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dunsin Tech | Local Classroom Quiz App</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;
            --text-main: #1f2937;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            background-color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 5%;
            background: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav a {
            margin-left: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #4b5563;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #eff6ff, #fff);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #4b5563;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        .features {
            padding: 60px 5%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            background: var(--bg-light);
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .pricing {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .price-card {
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            max-width: 350px;
            margin: 40px auto 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        footer {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
            padding: 40px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">Dunsin Tech</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
            <a href="mailto:support@dunsintech.com">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Run Offline Class Quizzes Instantly</h1>
        <p>The ultimate Local LAN Quiz system for schools. No internet required, no student setup needed, completely hosted from the teacher's laptop.</p>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn">Get Your License Now</a>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>🔒 100% Offline Economy</h3>
            <p>Runs perfectly on standard school routers without data plans or internet cables connected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>⚡ Zero Installation</h3>
            <p>Students participate directly by opening Chrome or Safari on their devices and typing a short local link.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>📊 Live Leaderboards</h3>
            <p>Teachers view student accuracy, score tickers, and countdown timers in real time from a single dashboard.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
        <h2>Simple, Transparent Pricing</h2>
        <p>Buy once, run forever in your school network.</p>
        
        <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Standard School License</h3>
            <p>Perfect for individual teachers and small computer labs.</p>
            <div class="price">$49</div>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 30px; color: #64748b;">Lifetime updates • Up to 3 server setups</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn" onclick="alert('Integrating your Payment gateway!')">Buy Software Pack</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Dunsin Tech. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
